window.EN={"1":"Having defeated the pegasus knight order led by Sigune in the midst of the blizzard, Roy and the others","2":"advance their army toward Castle Edessa in the southern part of the Ilia region.","3":"This castle, also the home base of a pegasus knight order, was originally under the command","4":"of Zelot, the head of a mercenary knight order, but in his absence it could not withstand Bern's invasion and surrendered.","5":"Since then, it has become the center of Bern's administration of Ilia.","6":"And now, in this land, in place of General Murdock of Bern's Three Dragon Generals, who had returned to the homeland,","7":"former Etrurian Prime Minister Roartz had been entrusted with the Bern garrison force.","8":"Roartz, alarmed by the speed of the advance of Roy and the Etrurian army,","9":"hastily sent word to Ilia's various knight orders asking them to side with him, but","10":"the replies he received were less than promising.","11":"Well then, have the troops gathered?","12":"That's just it, sir...","13":"We're ordering the knight orders scattered across the Ilia region to join us, but","14":"apart from the ones that came at General Murdock's call, the response has been lukewarm...","15":"Argh! What is the meaning of this!!","16":"...That's right, we were holding this castle's lady and the knights' families, weren't we.","17":"What about those families?","18":"Yes, sir, about that... they're constantly moving as a mercenary knight order, fighting all across the region,","19":"so even just pinning down where they are right now seems to be difficult.","20":"Grr...","21":"Ever since the Sigune Squadron, the pegasus knight order fighting for Bern, was defeated by the enemy,","22":"it seems the other knight orders across the region have grown even more hesitant to act...","23":"Argh! Every single one of them makes my blood boil!","24":"Me, the prime minister of the kingdom of Etruria, me of all people—you're telling me to fall in a backwater like this?!","25":"*cough* *cough*...","26":"Are you all right? Here, put this on.","27":"B-but that's... then Lady Yuno would—","28":"It's fine. I'm used to the cold. It's still far better than flying through the snow on a pegasus.","29":"...Thank you so much. *cough* *cough*","30":"Lady Yuno, what's going to become of us...?","31":"I don't know either. But let's keep holding onto hope.","32":"Maybe the occupying army will withdraw, or maybe our husbands will come back.","33":"It's not as though everything ahead of us is necessarily bleak.","34":"...Where could Lord Zelot and the others be?","35":"In his last letter, he wrote that he was going to join the Lycian Alliance, but after that...","36":"He might well be somewhere nearby, you know.","37":"I do hope that's so...","38":"Lord Roy... today again, the fighting is about to begin, isn't it.","39":"Yes. If we can take this castle,","40":"next we'll be advancing our army into Bern's homeland.","41":"Princess Guinevere.","42":"...Yes.","43":"May I ask you the reason?","44":"The reason King Zephiel was nearly assassinated by his father the king...","45":"...My brother and I had different mothers. We're half-siblings.","46":"I'd heard that King Zephiel's mother was an Etrurian princess?","47":"Yes. She was the woman who became Father's consort in order to strengthen the bond between Etruria and Bern.","48":"But Father already loved another woman by then—and that was my own mother.","49":".........","50":"As for the marriage between Father and my brother's mother, those around them—","51":"the other royalty and the senior vassals had forced it upon them, or so I'm told.","52":"Because of that, Father never loved my brother's mother, and he seems to have come to feel burdened by my brother because of it.","53":"Is that why the relationship between Bern's former king and King Zephiel soured?","54":"No, my brother, for his part, still tried desperately to earn Father's favor, even so.","55":"Both the knowledge and refinement befitting an heir to the throne, and the discipline befitting a commander who leads an army...","56":"My brother grew into a prince with nothing lacking, as one fit to inherit the kingdom of Bern.","57":"But then, if that's so, why did Bern's former king...","58":"Lord Roy! Preparations for the attack are complete!","59":"Understood. I'll be right there!","60":"Princess Guinevere, I'm terribly sorry, but...","61":"No, not at all. Please, take care...","62":"Yuno!","63":"You...","64":"Are you all right? Are you hurt? Did they treat you badly? Hm?","65":"My, my, the way you talk, it's as if you think you're dealing with a child.","66":"Even so, I was once a captain of the pegasus knight order, you know.","67":"That's true, but, still, well...","68":"I'm fine. I haven't been hurt, and I haven't been treated badly either.","69":"I see. That's good...","70":"But why with the Etrurian army? Weren't you part of the Lycian Alliance?","71":"Well, that's a bit of a complicated story...","72":"This army I currently belong to, the Etrurian army,","73":"is called that in name, but in truth, the main body is the Lycian Alliance army.","74":"My, so that's how it was.","75":"I'm sorry, that this happened to you while I was away.","76":"There's no helping it. It's the flow of the times that made it so.","77":"But still, to think I made you wear a soldier's uniform, of all things...","78":"My, dear, do you dislike the sight of me as a pegasus knight captain?","79":"No, it's not that at all! Certainly not, but...","80":"Then isn't it just fine?","81":"Besides, from now on, you'll be seeing it all the time anyway.","82":"What do you mean! You don't mean...","83":"Yes, I'll be going into battle too.","84":"No! No, no, absolutely not! You've already retired from the army!","85":"So, leave the fighting to us, and...","86":"But even while waiting like that, I still got caught up in the fighting, didn't I?","87":"In this day and age, there's no such thing as a safe place.","88":"That may well be true, but...","89":"That's exactly why I'll fight too.","90":"So that a time when we can live in peace, safely, arrives even a little sooner...","91":"Sister!","92":"Thea... why are you here?","93":"...It's a long story, but right now I've joined the Etrurian army.","94":"When I heard that this Edessa had fallen into Bern's hands,","95":"I was worried, but I'm glad you're safe...","96":"But you—","97":"Weren't you hired by the faction that was fighting the Etrurian army just now?","98":"Don't tell me you—","99":"That's not it! As an Ilia knight, I haven't broken my oath.","100":"I properly fulfilled my duty as a mercenary, and only after that did I...","101":"That's right, you're such a very serious girl. There's no way you'd do something like that.","102":"I'm sorry, for saying something so unnecessary.","103":"It's fine, don't worry about it. More to the point, Sister, that uniform of yours...","104":"This? Hee hee, what do you think?","105":"Do I still look up to the task, as captain of the pegasus knight order?","106":"Well, until recently, you certainly were, so...","107":"But why? Weren't you retired from the pegasus knights...?","108":"In an emergency like this, I can hardly keep saying that, can I?","109":"By myself, keeping everyone safe here was already all I could manage, but","110":"with you all, I feel I could stand up against Bern's army.","111":"So then, Sister, will you fight together with us too?","112":"Yes.","113":"I'm so happy!","114":"I never thought I'd get to fight shoulder to shoulder with you again.","115":"Hee hee hee... but don't think I'll lose to you two just yet.","116":"Big Sister Yuno!","117":"My, Shanna. Why are you here?","118":"I've been with this army this whole time, the one led by this general from the Etrurian army.","119":"When I heard that Edessa had been occupied by Bern's army, I was so shocked, but","120":"I believed that if it was Big Sister Yuno, you'd surely be all right.","121":"Eh, why's that?","122":"Because Big Sister Yuno was the captain of the glorious pegasus knight order, wasn't she!","123":"There's no way that sister of mine would lose to the likes of Bern.","124":"Thank you. It makes me happy to hear you say that.","125":"Unfortunately, right now, I'm a prisoner, though.","126":"Th-that's...","127":"But I don't intend to stay defeated by Bern either.","128":"By myself, keeping everyone safe here was already all I could manage, but","129":"with you all, I feel I could stand up against Bern's army.","130":"Eh, so then, Big Sister, will you fight together with us?","131":"Yes.","132":"Really? Yay!!","133":"My, my, there's no need to be so overjoyed...","134":"Because I've always admired Big Sister Yuno, and that's why I became a pegasus knight.","135":"Getting to fight together with you feels like a dream!","136":"My, Shanna, honestly, you're as dramatic as ever. Hee hee hee...","137":"Yuno!","138":"You...","139":"Are you all right? Are you hurt? Did they treat you badly? Hm?","140":"My, my, the way you talk, it's as if you think you're dealing with a child.","141":"Even so, I was once a captain of the pegasus knight order, you know.","142":"That's true, but, still, well...","143":"I'm fine. I haven't been hurt, and I haven't been treated badly either.","144":"I see. That's good...","145":"But why are you here? Weren't you part of the Lycian Alliance?","146":"Well, it's a matter of how things turned out...","147":"This General Roy, who leads this army, is also the one leading the current Lycian Alliance.","148":"My, so that's how it was.","149":"I'm sorry, that this happened while I was away.","150":"There's no helping it. It's the flow of the times that made it so.","151":"But still, to think I made you wear a soldier's uniform, of all things...","152":"My, dear, do you dislike the sight of me as a pegasus knight captain?","153":"No, it's not that at all! Certainly not, but...","154":"Then isn't it just fine?","155":"Besides, from now on, you'll be seeing it all the time anyway.","156":"What do you mean! You don't mean...","157":"Yes, I'll be fighting too.","158":"No! No, no, absolutely not! You've already retired from the army!","159":"So, leave the fighting to us, and...","160":"But even while waiting like that, I still got caught up in the fighting, didn't I?","161":"In this day and age, there's no such thing as a safe place.","162":"Well, that may well be true, but...","163":"That's exactly why I'll fight too.","164":"So that a time when we can live in peace, safely, arrives even a little sooner...","165":"Sister!","166":"Thea... you too, with this army?","167":"Yes, it's a long story.","168":"When I heard that this Edessa had fallen into Bern's hands,","169":"I was worried, but I'm glad you're safe...","170":"But you—","171":"Weren't you hired by the faction that was fighting the Etrurian army just now?","172":"Don't tell me you—","173":"That's not it! As an Ilia knight, I haven't broken my oath.","174":"I properly fulfilled my duty as a mercenary, and only after that did I...","175":"That's right, you're such a very serious girl. There's no way you'd do something like that.","176":"I'm sorry, for saying something so unnecessary.","177":"It's fine, don't worry about it. More to the point, Sister, that uniform of yours...","178":"This? Hee hee, what do you think?","179":"Do I still look up to the task, as captain of the pegasus knight order?","180":"Well, until recently, you certainly were, so...","181":"But why? Weren't you retired from the pegasus knights...?","182":"In an emergency like this, I can hardly keep saying that, can I?","183":"From now on, we'll be together, won't we.","184":"I'm so happy!","185":"I never thought I'd get to fight shoulder to shoulder with you again.","186":"Hee hee hee... but don't think I'll lose to you two just yet.","187":"Big Sister Yuno!","188":"My, Shanna. You too, with this army?","189":"Yeah, I've been part of it this whole time.","190":"When I heard that Edessa had been occupied by Bern's army, I was so shocked, but","191":"I believed that if it was Big Sister Yuno, you'd surely be all right.","192":"Eh, why's that?","193":"Because Big Sister Yuno was the captain of the glorious pegasus knight order, wasn't she!","194":"There's no way that sister of mine would lose to the likes of Bern.","195":"Thank you. It makes me happy to hear you say that.","196":"Up until now, I was a prisoner, though.","197":"Th-that's...","198":"But from now on, we get to fight together, don't we.","199":"Eh, really? Yay!!","200":"My, my, there's no need to be so overjoyed...","201":"Because I've always admired Big Sister Yuno, and that's why I became a pegasus knight.","202":"Getting to fight together with you feels like a dream!","203":"My, Shanna, honestly, you're as dramatic as ever. Hee hee hee...","204":"The blizzard has grown fierce... this march is likely to take longer than I expected.","205":"Once we take the castle, let's head for Bern right away.","206":"※If fought with Douglas: Douglas... hmph. All that talk, and","207":"in the end, you too are just following whoever's strongest, aren't you.","208":"Seen from the outside, perhaps that's so.","209":"But right now, there's not a single doubt in my heart.","210":"Hmph, spare me the talk!","211":"※If fought with any other unit: Someone, hurry! Come quickly! Will none of you protect me!","212":"If I, who should be a commander, were to be hurt, what would you all do about it!","213":"W-wait, submit to me, and it's still not too late...","214":"The crime of raising a blade against me—I'll make a special exception and forgive it... guh.","215":"※If Yuno and Zelot both survive, and the castle was taken within 25 turns","216":"This next step, at last, is Bern itself...","217":"Lord Roy, this is serious!","218":"It seems part of Bern's army has barricaded itself in some ruins on the outskirts of Edessa.","219":"Ruins?","220":"Yes. What's more, according to the locals,","221":"a spear from the age of the \"Scouring\" is said to be kept there...","222":"What! That spear, could it possibly be...","223":"The chances it's a \"Divine Weapon\" are quite high.","224":"I can't just sit still. Let's hurry to those ruins!","225":"※Only if all the NPC citizens survived (and left)","226":"Um, excuse me...","227":"Yes...?","228":"Are you the one who saved this castle?","229":"No, I'm not...","230":"Thank you so much!","231":"Thanks to you, we're able to be safe like this.","232":"Here, this is a token of our gratitude. Please, take it!","233":"Well then, we'll be on our way...","234":".........","235":"...I think I'll pass this along to Lord Roy.","236":"※If either Yuno or Zelot has died, or the castle was taken on turn 26 or later","237":"Princess Guinevere, we'll finally be advancing our army into Bern's homeland. Before that, though...","238":"...You mean about my brother, don't you.","239":"...At the time, Prince Zephiel, as heir to Bern,","240":"had grown up splendidly, hadn't he.","241":"So I've heard.","242":"Even so, Bern's former king came to resent Prince Zephiel, didn't he?","243":"Rather... it's because my brother had grown so remarkably.","244":"Eh...","245":"My father, Bern's former king, was, as a king, a man of ordinary talent, they say.","246":"So my brother's outstanding talent seems to have only made Father's feelings all the colder.","247":".........","248":"And then, one day at last, Father is said to have called my brother and told him:","249":"\"Someone fit for it shall be brought in to marry Guinevere, and he shall take the throne of Bern.\"","250":"What...! ...That's too much!","251":"Even so, my brother is said to have answered then that if that was how it was, so be it.","252":"But to my brother, who everyone expected to be the next king, those around him would not allow such a thing.","253":"And so, Father, driven to distraction...","254":"...Plotted to assassinate Prince Zephiel?","255":"...At a drinking banquet, my brother was handed a poisoned cup directly by our father the king.","256":"And that, it's said, was the first and last cup he ever received from Father...","257":"After returning to his room, my brother began to suffer,","258":"and for more than ten days after that, he is said to have hovered between life and death.","259":"He was sheltered by General Murdock, who had raised him,","260":"and somehow, my brother's life was spared.","261":"...Did Father do nothing after that?","262":"...No.","263":"He treated General Murdock, who had saved my brother, and my brother's mother as obstacles too,","264":"and is said to have schemed to do away with my brother along with them.","265":"My brother, still bedridden with illness, learned of this and feigned his own death...","266":"and when Father came to confirm my brother's death, from within the coffin... with a sword...","267":".........","268":"...At the time, I was still young, and had no way of understanding such circumstances.","269":"All I understood was that from that day—the day Father died—onward, my brother's face lost its smile.","270":"Until then, he could be strict, but he was a warm, gentle brother. That's why...","271":"Princess Guinevere...","272":"That's why, deep in my heart, I believed my brother hadn't changed.","273":"That someday, surely, he would return to being the kind Zephiel brother he once was.","274":"I believed that... I kept believing that, all along...","275":"I see, so that's how it was...","276":"...But now, my brother is somewhere my voice can no longer reach.","277":"Lord Roy, I beg you. Please... please stop my brother.","278":"Please make him stop tormenting Bern and the people of other regions any further.","279":"Even if it means appealing to the sword?","280":"...Ever since I entrusted everything to Lord Roy, I've made up my mind to it.","281":"Understood. I will definitely stop King Zephiel!","282":"I swear it on the \"Fire Emblem\" entrusted to me by the princess!","283":"※Only if all the NPC citizens survived (and left)","284":"Um, excuse me...","285":"Yes...?","286":"Are you the one who saved this castle?","287":"No, I'm not...","288":"Thank you so much!","289":"Thanks to you, we're able to be safe like this.","290":"Here, this is a token of our gratitude. Please, take it!","291":"Well then, we'll be on our way...","292":".........","293":"...I think I'll pass this along to Lord Roy."};
